OL,3,GNEWSACatherine's cancer documentary    
OL,4,Amakes me feel less alone, says         
OL,5,AStrictly's Amy Dowden                  
OL,7,FStrictly Come Dancing's Amy Dowden says
OL,8,Fthe upcoming documentary from          
OL,9,FCatherine, the Princess of Wales, about
OL,10,Fher cancer journey will help many      
OL,11,Fpeople, including herself, "not feel so
OL,12,Falone".                                
OL,14,FDowden praised the documentary and said
OL,15,Fit confirmed how "anyone can be dealt  
OL,16,Fthe devastating blow of a cancer       
OL,17,Fdiagnosis".                            
